      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I disagree, trust rank is already pretty useless, I've seen people make alts and get to Trusted in under 2 weeks. As long as shield settings work, and I can see the trust rank from their profile if needed, I don't need to know what someone's trust rank is on their nametag.\n\nThat and, I'd really rather not have the outline in its current form, recolored or not, at all....\n\nIt hurts the readability of names from further away for me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
