      "statusChangeID": "6a73c3d99dd18e954a341e01",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "We're not adding trust rank colors to nameplate outlines at this time. \n\nGoing back to giving trust rank more visibility isn't a direction we want to go.\n\nSeparately, we do want the existing shield icon to be easier to read, including for colorblind players. We'll work on that.",
